ikipedia.org/wiki/Bitexco_Financial_Tower\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Bitexco Financial Tower\">Bitexco Financial Tower</a>, Liberty Central Saigon Riverside Hotel, Renaissance Riverside Hotel Saigon, Melinh Point Tower, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon_Times_Square\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon Times Square\">Saigon Times Square</a>, Hilton Saigon Hotel, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vietcombank_Tower\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Vietcombank Tower\">Vietcombank Tower</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon_Centre\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon Centre\">Saigon Centre</a>, Sheraton Grand Opera Saigon Hotel, The Landmark, Saigon Riverside Office Center, Lotte Hotel Saigon and some significant low-rise buildings <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hotel_Majestic_(Saigon)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hotel Majestic (Saigon)\">Hotel Majestic</a>, Seaprodex 2-4-6 Đồng Khởi, Riverside Hotel, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tr%E1%BA%A7n_H%C6%B0ng_%C4%90%E1%BA%A1o\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Trần Hưng Đạo\">Trần Hưng Đạo</a> statue at <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%AA_Linh_Square\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Mê Linh Square\"> Mê Linh Square</a>, IBC Building, Vietnam People's Naval Army Barracks, Tôn Đức Thắng Museum","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Tran Van Ngoc","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}]},{"pageid":163199929,"ns":6,"title":"File:Lotte Hotel, Ho Chi Minh City.jpg","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":1769484,"width":3060,"height":3112,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Lotte_Hotel%2C_Ho_Chi_Minh_City.jpg/1280px-Lotte_Hotel%2C_Ho_Chi_Minh_City.jpg?utm_source=co